{"t":"055550.KS","n":"Shinhan Financial Group Co., Ltd.","nKo":"신한금융그룹","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":86600.0,"chg":4300.0,"chgPct":0.05225,"prev":82300.0,"dayH":86800.0,"dayL":82500.0,"w52H":116500.0,"w52L":74600.0,"vol":744987,"avgVol":903872,"mcap":40088155193344,"pe":null,"fpe":6.53,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":3100.0,"divY":0.0377,"beta":0.71,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Financial Services","sKo":"금융 서비스","i":"Banks - Regional","iKo":"은행 - 지역","city":"Seoul","emp":null,"web":"https://www.shinhangroup.com","sum":"Shinhan Financial Group Co., Ltd. provides financial products and services in South Korea and overseas. It offers credit, lending and receiving deposits; credit cards, short-term and long-term card loan services, installment financing, and leases; securities trading, consignment trading, and underwriting; life and non-life insurance business; facility rental and new technology business financing; and real estate trust, investment advisory services, venture business investment, and other businesses. Shinhan Financial Group Co., Ltd. was founded in 1982 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","sumKo":"신한금융그룹주식회사는 국내 및 해외에서 금융상품과 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 신용, 대출 및 예금 수령을 제공합니다. 신용카드, 장·단기 카드대출 서비스, 할부금융, 리스 등 증권매매, 위탁매매 및 인수 업무 생명 및 손해 보험 사업; 시설대여 및 신기술사업 자금조달 부동산 신탁, 투자자문, 벤처기업 투자, 기타 업무를 취급합니다. 신한금융그룹주식회사는 1982년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":13207300000000,"ni":4642292000000},{"y":2023,"rev":14247400000000,"ni":4368035000000},{"y":2024,"rev":14659800000000,"ni":4517524000000},{"y":2025,"rev":15438700000000,"ni":4971561000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":3603000000000,"ni":510618000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":4212400000000,"ni":1622594000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":4584300000000,"ni":1820135000000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":3981000000000,"ni":1584629000000}],"eps":[{"q":"4Q2025","act":983.0,"est":1272.191},{"q":"1Q2026","act":3312.0,"est":3283.471},{"q":"2Q2026","act":37